#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/flir-lepton.rst:25
msgid ""
"Drive the Lepton through `csi.CSI` with ``cid=`` `csi.LEPTON`. The driver "
"internally upscales the Lepton's 80x60 (1.x/2.x) or 160x120 (3.x) native "
"frame to whatever framesize you set::"
